{"4025330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "林葬屋前传：冥声", "steam_appid": 4025330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mourningwood Lodge2:Hidden Voice&quot; is a Chinese folk horror FMV mystery set around a forbidden ghost marriage ritual, a cursed nursery rhyme, and a series of grotesque deaths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In a decaying mansion buried deep within a forgotten village, every room hides a secret, every voice carries a lie, and every step draws you closer to something that should have remained sealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Investigate the truth behind the deaths, collect clues, connect fragmented memories, and make judgments that shape the outcome of the story. What happened here is not just a haunting — it is a buried crime, a family tragedy, and a curse that refuses to fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025330/extras/106f62c2a803b222bf31aa1e380829d0.avif?t=1777274098\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >​<strong>​Evidence Collection​</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chinese Folk Horror Atmosphere  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost marriage rituals, forbidden customs, eerie nursery rhymes, abandoned ancestral spaces, and a deeply unsettling Eastern horror aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025330/extras/3067dcc0a5b813fbbacac3f8cc07511b.avif?t=1777274098\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >​<strong>​Judgment​</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FMV Storytelling with Psychological Tension  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a cinematic horror mystery through live-action performances, layered reveals, and escalating dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025330/extras/e6b9a0eb88ac51fe6165e98e4e9dd7e6.avif?t=1777274098\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >​<strong>​Choices​</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigation and Judgment  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for evidence, piece together the hidden past, and decide what — and who — you believe.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025330/extras/03ad73e9e6c336a27ff50194c72e6bed.avif?t=1777274098\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >​<strong>​Investigation​</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching Choices, Multiple Endings  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions shape the truth you uncover and the fate that awaits each character.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025330/extras/4e025506a52d7df1b644d8e894eda0bd.avif?t=1777274098\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Supernatural </strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Mystery Built on Buried Sin  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the supernatural terror lies a human story of cruelty, silence, obsession, and retribution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025330/extras/30369c247a3955315a4be91bdae12f36.avif?t=1777274098\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you uncover the truth before the curse claims you too?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creator P